pplication/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"684a452acab1bdd1ff025347c6760361b1b7c8047f4d2c83f71266e663099221","event_uuid":"a0e122cc-a95b-4187-8a31-083955b1678d","position":{"commit_sha":"8dcb7f52df5e83441d48e4ca83f4653d02c3246c","position":"1786897581071008001-a0e122cc-a95b-4187-8a31-083955b1678d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"beaf986e165292dba1c93a0a38ad7160adecc94f26fb621d45d603b023c788e4","event_uuid":"13e76676-265c-45f2-b8c1-7094f58126f2","position":{"commit_sha":"698c915f3c409efbfbad652b103599ef35a76fc2","position":"1786897906731648001-13e76676-265c-45f2-b8c1-7094f58126f2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"5890be7d185aa07643964972727ab2f924979a833565f647a013cbfc7ea50153","event_uuid":"41628296-c3bc-4d1e-a2e8-c0991e623832","position":{"commit_sha":"caa12aab4977cf26518fe87de41f862ba4c2591a","position":"1786897909873266001-41628296-c3bc-4d1e-a2e8-c0991e623832"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Prior-ticket constraints and maintained-OSS survey (recorded here as the AC evidence artifact). cinderlike-weariful-angora requires a real loopback Git protocol server, upload-pack filter support inherited through a temporary global config, packet-trace proof of filter negotiation, a known missing historical blob, an incompressible historical object larger than 140 MiB for the pack guard, and yield/finally terminate-wait-kill cleanup; configuration inspection or mocks are insufficient. Maintained-project status was checked on 2026-08-15: git/git, jelmer/dulwich, and eclipse-jgit/jgit were unarchived and had pushes on 2026-08-15, 2026-08-15, and 2026-08-14 respectively. Evidence: Git's t/lib-git-daemon.sh at https://github.com/git/git/blob/f43d01ab90be2711927c8d265b3fb21d2213d2ab/t/lib-git-daemon.sh owns one loopback daemon per test script and registers stop_git_daemon at exit; t/test-lib-functions.sh at https://github.com/git/git/blob/a592d6feb3d47a1fcd6be5b4c8136e116c26ffbc/t/test-lib-functions.sh derives distinct ports for parallel stress jobs. Dulwich's partial-clone compatibility suite at https://github.com/jelmer/dulwich/blob/88dfdb60f2e6fd4aeb658cd369b361397af1fb36/tests/compat/test_partial_clone.py uses small blobs, an ephemeral TCPGitServer on port 0, per-test temporary repositories, and registered shutdown/server-close/thread-join cleanup while exercising real git clone filters. JGit's daemon tests at https://github.com/eclipse-jgit/jgit/blob/5c5f7c6b146b24f2bd4afae1902df85ad6e57ea3/org.eclipse.jgit.test/tst/org/eclipse/jgit/transport/DaemonTest.java start ephemeral-port daemons inside each test, stopAndWait, and prove the port can be reused after cleanup. Disposition: the maintained examples support isolated ephemeral protocol fixtures with explicit teardown; none supports one mutable server/object database shared across parallel workers. This ticket therefore keeps one isolated large guard, uses isolated small real-protocol fixtures for size-independent oracles, and does not adopt shared mutable state.","timestamp":1786852748211724001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implementation and validation evidence. Mapping: the three filter-negotiation/missing-object cases, both identity lanes, and reconvergence/push are size-independent and now use an isolated 1 KiB historical-object server; the workflow-absence test uses no server; only standalone full-versus-blobless pack guards retain the 141 MiB server, and their xdist group confines that build to one worker. Happy RED was the missing small_ticket_server fixture. Full held-out GREEN was 7 cases in 4.01s, including direct/named protocol paths, a full-fetch control, both identity lanes, and reconvergence/push; the implementer saw only the named-origin happy path and needed two attempts, with the second removing an unused large-fixture dependency found by runtime validation. Exact-defect mutation replaced the small payload with 141 MiB: the held-out pack oracle failed at 144432 KiB versus the 1024 KiB ceiling, then passed after restoration. CI-shaped macOS comparison, three workers with loadgroup: baseline 9 passed, pytest wall 78.85s, process real 113.08s, three large setups totaling about 99.99s, user plus sys 145.27s; final 10 passed, pytest wall 24.06s, process real 24.28s, large plus small setups totaling 14.78s, user plus sys 27.90s. Savings: pytest wall 69.5%, real wall 78.5%, setup 85.2%, aggregate CPU 80.8%. Each worker owns separate temporary repositories, object databases, ephemeral loopback port, daemon, and teardown; no mutable server is shared. The retained guards still use real Git protocol and the incompressible larger-than-140-MiB contrast; no mock replaces protocol behavior. Gates: held-out suite green; mutation had teeth; CI-shaped full file 10 passed; make lint green; make typecheck green; make test green with 13518 passed, 60 skipped, 289 deselected, 20 warnings in 4290.79s.","timestamp":1786881001096497001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Landing evidence: Gerrit change 1826 (I80cb2d08def492d049ef075839fcc63442067ef5), revision b5becd589773602602007a43e84a005fac0310fd, merged 2026-08-16 with LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. GitHub Verified run 31957415525 completed success in 1,353 seconds with no failed jobs. Local held-out GREEN, mutation RED, focused CI-shaped test, lint, typecheck, and make test evidence is recorded in the preceding comment. Residual-gap sweep: none; the maintained-OSS survey and retained large-object guard disposition are recorded. Session log: essential-cheesy-roach.","timestamp":1786897581071008001}],"created_at":1786827621345356001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"473d238a-1223-4500-923e-7498ade0fbcf","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"815d-8f56-7237-4b58"},{"link_uuid":"7061a5f0-2479-4e13-8f5a-a8674b1557bd","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"037b-879e-fe13-47d2"},{"link_uuid":"d1d0d358-9e3e-4b01-97e9-a0da29e5dd59","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"34e3-a239-eef1-443e"},{"link_uuid":"31546628-1ad9-42cc-9990-99a2125bfae9","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4dec-35f6-0539-411f"},{"link_uuid":"2c1a7e66-4eb5-460e-beb1-996b6f018951","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4955-ee7e-7738-42b1"}],"description":"## Context\nThe integration census attributes about 32.69 worker-phase seconds to partial-clone fixtures. The current fixture creates a real >100MiB object contrast and is duplicated per xdist worker. Closed cinderlike-weariful-angora deliberately requires proof that filter:blob:none is negotiated and omits a blob that materially distinguishes filtered from full history; that guard cannot be weakened or replaced by config inspection.\n\nA possible split is to retain one exact large-object guard and use a small real Git server/repository for protocol-only cases. Shared mutable servers may create races and cross-worker contamination, and no maintained-OSS consensus has yet been established.\n\n## Plan\n- Map each partial-clone test to protocol negotiation, missing-object, full-clone contrast, named/direct remote, standalone guard, reconvergence, and push behavior.\n- Freeze the one or more tests that require the >100MiB contrast.\n- Prototype isolated small fixtures only for cases whose failure oracle is independent of repository size; do not share mutable state across workers.\n- Seed negotiation, promisor, missing-object, and full-clone defects to prove equivalent detection.\n- Compare fixture setup, call time, macOS wall, and aggregate runner cost; survey maintained Git-heavy OSS suites.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The exact >100MiB filter contrast from cinderlike-weariful-angora remains covered by a real Git fixture.\n- [x] Every smaller-fixture candidate is proven size-independent by an exact-defect mutation.\n- [x] No mutable Git server or object database is shared across concurrent workers.\n- [x] Before/after macOS wall and runner savings are measured.\n- [x] Prior ticket constraints and at least three maintained OSS projects are recorded.\n- [x] No production behavior or external Git protocol coverage is replaced by mocks.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/integration/test_ci_tickets_partial_clone.py","reason":"Prototype size-independent real-Git protocol fixtures while retaining the required large-object guard."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","037b-879e-fe13-47d2"],["relates_to","34e3-a239-eef1-443e"],["relates_to","4955-ee7e-7738-42b1"],["relates_to","4dec-35f6-0539-411f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"13e76676-265c-45f2-b8c1-7094f58126f2","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["ci","test-runtime","research","git"],"ticket_id":"af11-aad5-bbe7-465a","ticket_type":"task","title":"Experiment with a small protocol fixture beside the required large partial-clone guard","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["d1d0d358-9e3e-4b01-97e9-a0da29e5dd59","fbb8f79f-22ff-4594-bc87-5e2e27ed9015","ec0e83b9-c9de-4e0a-b308-db27f2b66d1d","48b208b4-b58b-465d-a0f7-b53caec06ee7","aac95c28-a3dc-45b2-9085-72dc7f29e20e","c5917c51-d6b9-4568-889a-92f79016904a","72f2906b-051f-41ae-bceb-67d42452646d","31546628-1ad9-42cc-9990-99a2125bfae9","2c1a7e66-4eb5-460e-beb1-996b6f018951","a0e122cc-a95b-4187-8a31-083955b1678d","13e76676-265c-45f2-b8c1-7094f58126f2","41628296-c3bc-4d1e-a2e8-c0991e623832"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786902580348479001,"uuid":"567a16ba-fa2b-41dd-99f4-74d772ca73d2"}